Item_10_Comment:
The frequency distribution of effective size and fitted by a Gaussian function was performed to testify to the data normal distribution and the possible publication bias of the collected articles (
Lu et al., 2011
; 
Luo et al., 2006
). Fig. S3 showed that the distribution of effective size was well-fitted in the Gaussian curve (R2 = 0.9914, P < 0.001), which indicated that the results were unaffected by the potential publication bias, and the meta-analysis results were convincing (Fig. S3).
